From 7a8b9c0d1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f9a0b1c2d3e4f5a6b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Huy7684 <huyplus7684@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 16:20:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Fix shortcut menu crash, portrait capture hang, and night mode HAL crash

- Fallback to standard ResourcesCompat.getDrawable in se/a when obfuscated
  assets (e.g. ic_west_coast_princess.webp) cannot be opened from AssetManager,
  fixing top shortcut menu expand crash.
- Force shotType to 0 in Portrait ShotTypeHandler (h7/g) to bypass missing dual
  bokeh/depth streams and save photos immediately without hanging thumbnail.
- Force shotType to 0 in Night ShotTypeHandler (h7/j) to bypass unsupported
  vendor SuperNight raw burst capture request causing HAL error 4 crash.
